    <string name="gif_placeholder">Search KLIPY</string>
    <string name="gif_attribution">Powered by KLIPY</string>
    <string name="gif_off_line1">Search and send GIFs without leaving the keyboard.</string>
    <string name="gif_off_line2">It\'s off: until you turn it on, the keyboard doesn\'t connect to KLIPY.</string>
    <string name="gif_off_button">See what\'s sent and turn it on</string>
    <string name="gif_disclosure_1">Only what you type in the GIF search, a random anonymous ID, your country and the filter level are sent. What you type in apps is never sent.</string>
    <string name="gif_disclosure_2">It goes to KLIPY, a service from another company (not Resyst). GIFs load straight from KLIPY, which sees your IP like in any connection. When you send a GIF, KLIPY is told which one.</string>
    <string name="gif_disclosure_3">Every connection is noted in Settings › About › Connection log.</string>
    <string name="gif_disclosure_4">Turn it off any time in Settings › Clipboard and privacy: the ID is deleted and it connects no more.</string>
